                "at": "files",
                "label": "Limits",
                "title": "Uncopyable",
                "body": "Files, sockets, locks.",
                "code": "TypeError"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "recap",
          "say": "To recap. Assignment never copies: it aliases. A shallow copy duplicates only the outer container, and shares everything nested. A deep copy recurses, with a memo for shared references and cycles. Choose shallow for immutable contents, deep for independent nested state.",
